  "title": "AnalyticsPage uses Tailwind CSS classes but Tailwind is NOT installed - page renders unstyled",
  "description": "R6 deep audit finding. Dimension: UI. Severity: P0. Source SHA: bbd487a3. Scope: R6_DEEP_AUDIT_WAVE. AnalyticsPage exclusively uses Tailwind CSS utility classes (e.g., 'grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6' on line 155, 'bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4' on line 157, 'text-center py-12 text-slate-500' on line 261). CONFIRMED: Tailwind CSS is NOT installed in retailer-admin — there is no tailwindcss in package.json, no tailwind.config.* file, and the only mention of 'tailwind' is a comment in index.css referencing the supplier-portal's Tailwind config. This means ALL Tailwind utility classes on the AnalyticsPage are inert — the page renders as completely unstyled content with no grid layout, no backgrounds, no padding, no typography, no responsive behavior.",
